title Home Assistant: the phone's login was refused: the Connect page says so and keeps the code
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO connect
env HA_DEMO_PHONE refused

wait 1800
shot refused
check refused
expect text "Home Assistant refused the sign-in (access_denied). Scan the code again."
expect noquit
